        "source": "book 4 (the snowplough): the gearbox sub-build, pages 37 to 61 (https://www.lego.com/cdn/product-assets/product.bi.additional.extra.pdf/9397_X_9397%20Container%20Truck%20with%20Snowplow%20%231.pdf#page=37 to #page=61), the motor at page 59; book 5: the battery box, step 142 (page 103, https://www.lego.com/cdn/product-assets/product.bi.additional.extra.pdf/9397_X_9397%20Container%20Truck%20with%20Snowplow%20%232.pdf#page=103)",
